g class="h-4 w-4 text-[#1f6fe0] md:h-[18px] md:w-[18px]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></span></td><td class="px-1.5 py-3 text-center sm:px-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center" role="img" aria-label="Included"><svg class="h-4 w-4 text-[#1f6fe0] md:h-[18px] md:w-[18px]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></span></td></tr><tr class="border-t border-black/[0.05]"><th scope="row" class="px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-normal leading-snug text-gray-700 sm:px-5 sm:text-sm md:px-7">SSO / SAML</th><td class="px-1.5 py-3 text-center sm:px-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center" role="img" aria-label="Not included"><span class="block h-px w-3.5 bg-gray-300"></span></span></td><td class="px-1.5 py-3 text-center sm:px-3"><span class="block text-[11px] font-medium leading-tight text-gray-700 md:text-[13px]">Contact sales</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="mt-6 space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-black/[0.06] bg-white/60 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600"><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">After Pro ends</h3><p>After cancellation, when your paid Pro period ends, existing accounts have limited access: 100 dictation sessions and 25 Agent Mode sessions per week. This is not a plan available at sign-up.</p></div></div></section><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a free trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every new account starts with a 7-day free trial of Pro. A card is required at checkout, and you can cancel any time before the trial ends. One trial per email address."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens when the trial ends?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your plan starts automatically on the billing cycle you chose at checkout, monthly or annual, at the price shown there. When the trial begins we email you the date and the amount of that first charge, so nothing arrives as a surprise."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I cancel anytime?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Cancel from Settings, then Billing inside the app. You keep Pro until the end of the period you have already paid for."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens to my account if I cancel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"After cancellation, when your paid Pro period ends, existing accounts have limited access: 100 dictation sessions and 25 Agent Mode sessions per week. This is not a plan available at sign-up."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer discounts?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Students get 50% off Pro while enrolled, and we re-check enrollment once a year. Builders shipping their own VoiceOS integrations can apply for 50% off Pro. Both are short application forms that we read by hand."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between monthly and annual?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Annual is billed once a year and works out to 60% less per month than paying monthly. The prices on the cards above update to your region automatically."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which platforms does VoiceOS run on?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Mac and Windows today. Mobile is on the way and you can join the waitlist from the mobile page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you have plans for teams?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"VoiceOS offers Enterprise for teams. Contact us to confirm available administration, retention, and identity-provider requirements in your agreement."}}]}</script><section id="pricing-faq" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 relative overflow-hidden bg-transparent px-4 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-28"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 relative mx-auto max-w-3xl"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 mb-12 text-center md:mb-14"><h2 class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 section-title text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 liquid-glass-card overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-3"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"><button style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:none" aria-expanded="false" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border-none px-6 py-5 text-left outline-none transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/30 focus:border-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none md:px-8"><span class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 pr-6 text-base font-normal text-gray-900 md:text-lg">Is there a free trial?</span><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"></path></svg></button><div style="grid-template-rows:0fr" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 ease-out"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 overflow-hidden"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 px-6 pb-5 font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:px-8 [&amp;_b]:font-medium [&amp;_b]:text-gray-800">Yes. Every new account starts with a <b>7-day free trial of Pro</b>. A card is required at checkout, and you can cancel any time before the trial ends. One trial per email address.</div></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 mx-6 border-b border-gray-100/50 md:mx-8"></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"><button style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:none" aria-expanded="false" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border-none px-6 py-5 text-left outline-none transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/30 focus:border-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none md:px-8"><span class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 pr-6 text-base font-normal text-gray-900 md:text-lg">What happens when the trial ends?</span><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"></path></svg></button><div style="grid-template-rows:0fr" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 ease-out"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 overflow-hidden"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 px-6 pb-5 font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:px-8 [&amp;_b]:font-medium [&amp;_b]:text-gray-800">Your plan starts automatically on the billing cycle you chose at checkout, monthly or annual, at the price shown there. When the trial begins we email you <b>the date and the amount</b> of that first charge, so nothing arrives as a surprise.</div></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 mx-6 border-b border-gray-100/50 md:mx-8"></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"><button style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:none" aria-expanded="false" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border-none px-6 py-5 text-left outline-none transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/30 focus:border-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none md:px-8"><span class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 pr-6 text-base font-normal text-gray-900 md:text-lg">Can I cancel anytime?</span><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"></path></svg></button><div style="grid-template-rows:0fr" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 ease-out"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 overflow-hidden"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 px-6 pb-5 font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:px-8 [&amp;_b]:font-medium [&amp;_b]:text-gray-800">Yes. Cancel from <b>Settings, then Billing</b> inside the app. You keep Pro until the end of the period you have already paid for.</div></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 mx-6 border-b border-gray-100/50 md:mx-8"></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"><button style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:none" aria-expanded="false" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border-none px-6 py-5 text-left outline-none transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/30 focus:border-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none md:px-8"><span class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 pr-6 text-base font-normal text-gray-900 md:text-lg">What happens to my account if I cancel?</span><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"></path></svg></button><div style="grid-template-rows:0fr" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 ease-out"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 overflow-hidden"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 px-6 pb-5 font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:px-8 [&amp;_b]:font-medium [&amp;_b]:text-gray-800">After cancellation, when your paid Pro period ends, existing accounts have limited access: 100 dictation sessions and 25 Agent Mode sessions per week. This is not a plan available at sign-up.</div></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 mx-6 border-b border-gray-100/50 md:mx-8"></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"><button style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:none" aria-expanded="false" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border-none px-6 py-5 text-left outline-none transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/30 focus:border-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none md:px-8"><span class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 pr-6 text-base font-normal text-gray-900 md:text-lg">Do you offer discounts?</span><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"></path></svg></button><div style="grid-template-rows:0fr" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 ease-out"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 overflow-hidden"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 px-6 pb-5 font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:px-8 [&amp;_b]:font-medium [&amp;_b]:text-gray-800">Students get <b>50% off Pro while enrolled</b>, and we re-check enrollment once a year. Builders shipping their own VoiceOS integrations can apply for <b>50% off Pro</b>. Both are short application forms that we read by hand.</div></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 mx-6 border-b border-gray-100/50 md:mx-8"></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"><button style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:none" aria-expanded="false" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border-none px-6 py-5 text-left outline-none transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/30 focus:border-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none md:px-8"><span class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 pr-6 text-base font-normal text-gray-900 md:text-lg">What is the difference between monthly and annual?</span><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"></path></svg></button><div style="grid-template-rows:0fr" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 ease-out"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 overflow-hidden"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 px-6 pb-5 font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:px-8 [&amp;_b]:font-medium [&amp;_b]:text-gray-800">Annual is billed once a year and works out to <b>60% less per month</b> than paying monthly. The prices on the cards above update to your region automatically.</div></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 mx-6 border-b border-gray-100/50 md:mx-8"></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"><button style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:none" aria-expanded="false" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border-none px-6 py-5 text-left outline-none transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/30 focus:border-none focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none md:px-8"><span class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 pr-6 text-base font-normal text-gray-900 md:text-lg">Which platforms does VoiceOS run on?</span><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-gray-400 transition-transform duration-200 "><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9"></path></svg></button><div style="grid-template-rows:0fr" class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 ease-out"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 overflow-hidden"><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 px-6 pb-5 font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 md:px-8 [&amp;_b]:font-medium [&amp;_b]:text-gray-800"><b>Mac and Windows</b> today. Mobile is on the way and you can join the waitlist from the mobile page.</div></div></div><div class="jsx-2ae46a08699e61e9 mx-6 border-b 